Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level three!

3
00:00:11.938 --> 00:00:15.590
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.927
Today we learn: Natural Disasters. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.666 --> 00:00:23.349
Earthquake. Say it with me. Earthquake!

6
00:00:26.802 --> 00:00:30.135
Flood. Say it with me. Flood!

7
00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:37.751
Evacuation. Say it with me. Evacuation!

8
00:00:41.282 --> 00:00:45.582
Preparedness. Say it with me. Preparedness!

9
00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:53.343
Emergency kit. Say it with me. Emergency kit!

10
00:00:56.809 --> 00:01:00.125
Shelter. Say it with me. Shelter!

11
00:01:03.664 --> 00:01:07.947
Alert system. Say it with me. Alert system!

12
00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:15.022
Damage. Say it with me. Damage!

13
00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:22.960
Relief effort. Say it with me. Relief effort!

14
00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:29.933
Rebuild. Say it with me. Rebuild!

15
00:01:33.404 --> 00:01:37.471
Resilience. Say it with me. Resilience!

16
00:01:40.915 --> 00:01:44.481
Survival. Say it with me. Survival!

17
00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:57.054
Grammar time! Second conditional. Listen. If a flood happened, we would evacuate immediately.

18
00:01:57.104 --> 00:02:03.065
Your turn. Say it with me. If a flood happened, we would evacuate immediately.

19
00:02:08.341 --> 00:02:15.727
During the flood, the alert system helped with evacuation. Preparedness and an emergency kit made a big difference for our survival.

20
00:02:15.777 --> 00:02:17.065
I like this story!

21
00:02:18.556 --> 00:02:23.700
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:24.944
Evacuation!

23
00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:31.328
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:31.378 --> 00:02:32.616
Alert system!

25
00:02:33.723 --> 00:02:43.171
Think and answer. How can communities prepare for natural disasters?

26
00:02:43.221 --> 00:02:44.513
Great answer!

27
00:02:45.618 --> 00:02:50.023
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

28
00:02:50.073 --> 00:02:51.754
